  "notes": [
    "This file records owner-requested field requirements, not any real player's details and not the approved application schema.",
    "Registered email, sign-in providers, emergency contacts and associated guardian accounts are recorded separately under TM-PR-003; their field-level and access details remain review-gated.",
    "The proposed-mandatory label is the owner's preference only. Minimise and justify each mandatory field for each player age group before production; support an alternative where a junior has no personal phone or an identifiable photo is inappropriate.",
    "Optional marketing-profile data must not be collected by default or used for promotional outreach based solely on profile completion. Consent/permission, age safeguards, visibility, purpose and withdrawal remain separate decisions.",
    "School or institution, precise address, images and social handles must never be published in a public player roster by default; future server access must be separately scoped and verified.",
    "No sensitive medical, injury or safeguarding records are authorised by this inventory."
  ],
